ADDITIONAL ETHICAL NOTICE

This repository contains deliberately vulnerable code for educational
research. The vulnerable variants are intended to be run only against the
loopback address (127.0.0.1) and only against data the operator controls.
Do not point these lab servers at production systems, real customer data,
or any third-party service. Use coordinated-disclosure processes when
reporting vulnerabilities you discover elsewhere.
